WEBVTT

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.768
One of those colleagues was Esther Perel,
the relationship therapist,

00:00:30.792 --> 00:00:34.393
and host of the popular podcast,
"Where Should We Begin?"

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:38.476
We'd only met once before,
but she didn't hold back in her feedback.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.851
She told me my talk was
all facts, no feelings.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.059
That if I wanted to reach people,
I couldn't stop at information.

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:47.643
I needed to inject
some emotion into the talk.

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:50.184
Right then I knew I had
found a great new member

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:51.851
of my Challenge Network,

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:55.976
someone with common interests,
but a very different style and worldview.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.559
It was clear that her work on the couch
reached far beyond what happens at home.